This license covers the specification only. It does not cover:

- the KT3 Player application, which has its own terms;
- extensions made by others, which belong to their authors;
- the names "KT3" and "KT3 Player". You may say that your extension is "for KT3 Player",
  but please do not use these names in a way that suggests your extension is official
  or made by keitodaze.

